WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:15.280
Open the policy folder used by the recorded assistant.

2
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:21.320
The Admin role imported nine fictional policy PDFs into this folder.

3
00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:28.960
The folder creation route begins with Create a Folder.

4
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:42.560
This completed example fills the folder form, then cancels it.

5
00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:49.800
DataIQ, the records workspace, keeps HR's general questions on a board.

6
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:57.360
The Fields tab defines the question and answer fields.

7
00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:06.040
The assistant reads the separate approved-answers board.

8
00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:15.360
FlowOps, the workflow builder, logs questions and publishes approved answers.

9
00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:23.160
New Flow imports the two prepared workflow templates.

10
00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:37.240
The import uses the FlowOps-template copies.

11
00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:48.560
The logging skill points its board steps at HR's question queue.

12
00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:58.280
MCP supplies the board field IDs used by the publishing flow.

13
00:01:58.280 --> 00:02:15.760
The question board's automation connects a status change to its publishing flow.

14
00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:22.420
The publishing flow rereads the record before copying an approved answer.

15
00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:26.180
AgentIQ, the assistant builder, holds the recorded policy assistant.

16
00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:36.580
The assistant configuration uses System Bedrock and DeepSeek V3.2.

17
00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:46.340
Behavior Settings brings the core task and question-logging skill together.

18
00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:52.860
Supporting Knowledge connects the fictional policies and the approved-answers board.

19
00:02:52.860 --> 00:03:01.900
The Admin role attached both knowledge sources in this recorded build.

20
00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:17.600
Choose the recorded assistant in InsightsIQ, iMBrace's chat workspace.

21
00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:43.960
An automated test asks the assistant about an older leave rule.

22
00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:51.760
The current answer cites HR-POL-001 v3: five days, by 31 March.

23
00:03:51.760 --> 00:04:00.000
Review the policy citation alongside the recorded reply.
